# Creator OS V2 — Cursor project rule

Read `AGENTS.md` first. It is the canonical project contract.

Then read only the V2 documents relevant to the task:
- `docs/creator-os-v2.md`
- `docs/workflow-v2.md`
- `docs/video-plugin-routing.md` for video capability selection

## Product rules

- Product success is `READY_TO_PUBLISH`.
- If mandatory manual Jianying/CapCut re-edit is still required, status is `BLOCKED`.
- One Creative Contract owns story, Hook, format, voice mode and visual direction.
- Allowed output formats: `VIDEO`, `CAROUSEL`, `TEXT`.
- Douyin URLs are first-class reference inputs with honest acquisition fallback.
- Final video narration is the timing authority; character-count subtitle timing is forbidden.
- Repair only the failed layer; default maximum 3 rounds.

## Capability freeze

Do not add, upgrade, remove or bulk-rewrite existing Skills/plugins/vendor resources during normal production. Use installed capabilities only when the Creative Contract requires them.

## Engine rules

`python -m avs` remains the deterministic execution engine. Preserve input originals and supported engine state transitions. Engine `DELIVERY_READY` maps to product `READY_TO_PUBLISH` only after the V2 review contract passes.

## Repository hygiene

Do not recreate deleted quant-video reports, `fixtures/golden-ai-quant`, `build_ep01_v*`, `build_ep01_final*` or `final_final_*` one-off production paths.

Before claiming completion, run project verification and report actual command results.
